1320	    // causal triangular load -- early m-tiles are light, late ones heavy -- on fixed CTAs), each CTA
1321	    // pulls the next tile from a global atomic counter. The producer's lead thread grabs + publishes the
1322	    // index through a tiny smem FIFO (schW/schF/schE) so both warpgroups process the SAME stream while
1323	    // the GPU load-balances across CTAs the way the HW block scheduler does for the per-tile grid.
